# Object Property: <https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001003> (has base)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 <https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001003> "Relates a pizza to the base that is a part of it."@en)
